# Licence

## Scope, read this first

This licence covers the **design system**: the CSS, tokens, themes, components, behaviours, build
scripts, identity artwork and documentation in this repository.

It does **not** cover `fonts/`. Those twelve files are licensed retail typefaces that Greenwich
Steps LLC did not create and cannot sublicense:

- **Canela** and **Canela Text** — Commercial Type
- **GT America** — Grilli Type

They are present here in error and are being removed; see GRE-403. Nothing in this file grants any
right to use, copy, modify or redistribute them. If you have cloned or forked this repository, you
have not acquired a licence to those files, and you should obtain your own from the foundry before
using them. The kit degrades to the fallback stacks in `tokens.css` (Georgia, system-ui) when
`fonts.css` is not loaded, so it works without them.

